{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-05/1065046/block/singleImage/3274359/df/building_243.jpg?updatedAt=1795337191\"/><figcaption>裘錦秋中學(葵涌)。(家校會《中學概覽》圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>位於安捷街、正進行工程的裘錦秋中學，昨(21日)晨10時19分突有石屎從高處剝落墮下。事故除擊毀多部停泊在場的車輛外，亦波及5名學生，他們分別出現頭痛、耳痛及眼部受傷，事後全數被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。警方接報到場調查後，將案件列作「有人意外受傷」處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:43:51.694780+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:46:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:57:11.814452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:37:16.134654+00:00","content_hash":"57e55ed4022c3b7b767274c7cada12d613c5a859344c6de4daaf03269c5252cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:43:51.694780+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}